# Methods written as calls on a value, lib/sugar/method_calls.warp (card sugar-list-methods): no Rust twin of its own

# a_method_of_the_programs_function_is_its_call
is! 'twice(x, k) := x * k
n = 4
n.twice(3)' 12

# the_programs_own_remove_leaves_the_removal
is! 'remove(a, b) := 99
m = {a: 1, b: 2}
v = m.remove("a")
[v, count(m)]' [1, 1]
